This crate (`symphonia-format-vqf`) is a from-scratch, pure-Rust demuxer for NTT TwinVQ (`.vqf`)
files. It is licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0, like the rest of Project Symphonia.

NTT never published a specification of the container. The chunk layout (the `TWIN` marker, the
`COMM`, `DSIZ`, `DATA` and metadata chunks), the mapping of chunk names to tags, the frame sizes
per sample rate and bit rate, the packet format handed to the decoder (bit skip count, previous
byte, frame bytes), and the seek calculation follow FFmpeg's `libavformat/vqf.c`
(Copyright (c) 2009 Vitor Sessak), which is distributed under the GNU Lesser General Public
License, version 2.1 or later. The LGPL-2.1+ terms apply to those derived portions.
